# AI-assisted translation; native-speaker review pending.
tethered.title = Bōk pija kōn kamera eo ej jokwe ilo kein jerbal
tethered.capture = Bōk pija
tethered.invalid_name = Kālet etan eo e 1–120 byte, ejjelok slash, kolon, kakōlle in percent, ak dot ilo jinoin.
tethered.install = Laibrari in kamera an system ejjab maroñ jerbal. Kōmmane install eo an kamera runtime ñan platform in im bar kōjino Schist.
tethered.timeout = Iien kōttar ñan kajjitōk eo ñan kamera emōj. Lale kamera eo im bar kobaiki mokta jān am bar kajjioñ.
tethered.failed = Kajjitōk eo ñan kamera ejjab lo tōbrak: {detail}
tethered.unsupported = Kamera in ejjab kwalok ke emaroñ bōk pija jān etto.
tethered.no_download = Kamera eo ejjab kōtlok juon pija eo e mat. Pija ko jinoin rej pād wōt ilo kamera eo.
tethered.session_help = Kālet juon kamera, innem Bōk pija. Ilo pija eo jinoin, kālet jikin kōjparok im jino etan file; pija ko rej bōk nōmba in an toor im file extension an kamera eo. Kōjparok āinwōt ej ukot jikin kōjparok im jino etan file.
tethered.preview_failed = Pija eo emōj kōjparok im import, ak preview eo ejjab maroñ decode. Kōpelok file eo ilo editor ñan am lale.
tethered.partial = Jet file in pija ko emōj kōjparok im import; file ko jet rejab maroñ kōjparok: {error}
tethered.camera_permission = Kōtlok kamera ilo System Settings → Privacy & Security → Camera, innem bar kajjioñ Bōk pija. Elane Schist ej jino jān terminal, lale bareinwōt kōtlok kamera an terminal eo.
tethered.camera_usage_missing = Build in ejjelok kōmeļeļe kōn kōtlok kamera. Bar kalōk Schist kōn make ak kōjerbal app eo emōj package.
tethered.select_camera = Kālet juon kamera ñan bōk pija.
tethered.choose_destination = Bōk pija enaj kajjitōk ia eo kwōj kōjparok pija ko am.
tethered.preview_empty = Bōk juon pija ñan am loe ijin.
